  "' is available and has been selected.": "",
  "' uses direct IP Address connections.  You will need the IP address of the host player you are planning to join.  They do not need yours, and you do not need to do any special configuration on your local machine (other than letting the game past your software firewall, if you have not already).": "",
  "\nAdditionally, each player will need to be using the same port for the game, which can be any port.  The current port you are using is: ": "",
  "<color=#57a2f7>Make Sure You Have The IP Address And Port Of The Host!</color>\n": "",
  "' uses direct IP Address connections.  You will need to provide one of your IP addresses to the other players who want to join a game with you.  For your convenience, the public and private IP addresses, and explanations regarding them, are all on the Networking tab of the settings menu.  You can also copy and paste the addresses from there to give to others.\n\nHere is a quick list of your addresses at the moment:": "",
